<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>KSL Probe</string>
	<!--
	Export compliance. The app uses encryption beyond the exemptions of Apple's form: Kuicksilver embeds OpenSSL
	(TLS 1.3 for QUIC and HTTP/3). For mass-market software that only secures its own communication this is commonly
	classified 5D992.c under EAR 740.17(b)(1), which needs no export documents but must be declared: true here.
	The decision is the app owner's, not the library's; see docs/guide/ios.md, "Export compliance".
	-->
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
